// Gifts: the player picked something from their inventory and offered it ("I brought you something").
// {gift} is the item's name. "~ take_gift" is when the pony actually takes it - one of it, with the
// feelings that come with it (more for their favorite). Without it, the player keeps the item.
//
// gift(favorite) is the pony's favorite; gift(minecraft:poppy, #minecraft:flowers) matches items.
// can_take_gift is false once they've had enough gifts from you today - they can say so.
//
// PLACEHOLDER LINES - a scaffold showing the shape; every line here is meant to be rewritten.


=== too_many_today
start: gift
weight: 100
when: not can_take_gift, not bracelet, not granting_wish
{pony}: Oh, you've already given me so much today! Keep it, really.

=== favorite
start: gift
when: can_take_gift, gift(favorite), not bracelet, not granting_wish
{pony}: Is that... a {gift}? It's my favorite! Thank you!
~ take_gift

=== thanks
start: gift
when: can_take_gift, not gift(favorite), not bracelet, not granting_wish
{pony}: A {gift}? That's sweet of you. Thank you!
    or: Oh! For me? Thanks, {player}.
~ take_gift

=== cranky_thanks
start: gift
weight: 3
when: can_take_gift, not gift(favorite), personality(cranky), not bracelet, not granting_wish
{pony}: Hmph. A {gift}. ...Thanks, I suppose.
~ take_gift

=== grieving_thanks
start: gift
weight: 5
when: can_take_gift, mood(grief, clear), not bracelet, not granting_wish
{pony}: *quietly* Thank you. That means a lot right now.
~ take_gift


// ---- A thoughtful gift: the thing they mentioned missing (README: Friendship, deepened) ----
// granting_wish: the gift answers a wish this pony told *you* about. Always welcome, even past
// the day's gifts. "~ grant_wish" takes it - a happy memory, and a little more Trust.

=== wish_granted
start: gift
weight: 300
when: granting_wish
{pony}: Wait - a {gift}? You remembered! I can't believe you remembered.
~ grant_wish


// ---- The Friendship Bracelet (README: Becoming friends, concretely) ----
// A plain bracelet is only taken once the pony is close enough (friend_ready). "~ befriend" makes it
// real: they take it, you're friends, and you get one back in their colors.

=== bracelet_yes
start: gift
weight: 100
when: bracelet, friend_ready
{pony}: A friendship bracelet? For me? ...Yes. Yes, of course we're friends!
~ befriend

=== bracelet_already
start: gift
weight: 100
when: bracelet, friend
{pony}: Silly - we're already friends! Keep it for somepony new.

=== bracelet_not_yet
start: gift
weight: 100
when: bracelet, not friend_ready, not friend
{pony}: Oh... that's really sweet. But I feel like we're still getting to know each other. Ask me again sometime?
    or: A friendship bracelet? I - I'd like that, someday. Let's spend a little more time together first.
